0K MILE SPARTAN NO-COST MAINTENANCE PLAN INCLUDED - (A Realm Exclusive) and a *2-YEAR or 24K MILE LIMITED WARRANTY. For more details contact Motor Home Specialist today. REALM, by definition, is a royal kingdom; a domain within which anything may occur, prevail, or dominate. The Realm of Dreams is here and available at Motor Home Specialist, the #1 Volume Selling Motor Home Dealership in the World. Visit MHSRV.com or call 800-335-6054 for complete details, photos, videos, brochures, and more. The Foretravel Realm Presidential Series... Your Kingdom Awaits. 2026 REALM PRESIDENTIAL EXCLUSIVES: • Rear Cap with Stainless Accents and Linier Taillights • Illuminated Logo Badge on Front Cap • Black Octane Wheels with Matching Black Accents • Presidential Badging • LED Lead Rail Light Kits on Driver Side Awning Shells • Paint Graphics Running through Awning Shells and Slide Toppers • LED Accents on Bottom of all Slide Rooms • Ability to Display Cameras on TV’s • Knoedler Air Ride Pilot Seat with Swivel Base, Heat, Cool and Massage Feature (With Haptic Warning System) • Silverleaf Rozie Controller to Check on the Coach While Away • 18 Bottle Wine Chiller (Excludes LV3 FP) • HeadHunter Mach 5 120v Water Pump • Handcrafted Laminate Cabinetry with Presidential Series Designed Interiors • Frameless Residential Shower Door • Infinity Light Box in Ceiling Recess with AC discharge vents • 3-Form Art Inserts on Pocket Doors and Half Bath Door • Ability to Dump Tanks from Inside the Coach • Pneumatic Pocket Doors (Single Door Only) • Kitchen Window Above Countertop • Closet Cabinets Next to Dresser with Four Drawers at Bottom (Floorplan Dependent) • Illuminated Closet Rods • Motorized Luxury King Size Mattress • Aqua Hot Hydronic Heating 600D • Quick Access Interior Load Center • Delta Mobile 360 aiDAIRS Camera System • 10” House Control Panel • Fresco Windows with Motorized Driver Window","photos":["https://d17qgzvii7d4wm.cloudfront.net/s3/img.rv/2321/i/4535029/o/1_2321_4535029_3084